      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chain_of_Rocks_Bridge"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The bridge’s name derives from the Chain of Rocks rapids that once made that stretch of the Mississippi treacherous.",
