      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chain_of_Rocks_Bridge"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today the old bridge carries only pedestrians and cyclists, while the newer New Chain of Rocks Bridge handles vehicular traffic.",
